#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:8
msgid "Maintain source checkout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:21
msgid ""
"If you have installed ROS 2 from source, there may have been changes made to "
"the source code since the time that you checked it out. To keep your source "
"checkout up to date, you will have to periodically update your ``ros2."
"repos`` file, download the latest sources, and rebuild your workspace."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:25
msgid "Update your repository list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:27
msgid ""
"Each ROS 2 release includes a ``ros2.repos`` file that contains the list of "
"repositories and their version for that release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:31
msgid "Latest ROS 2 Rolling branches"
msgstr "最新的 ROS 2 Rolling 分支"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:33
msgid ""
"If you wish to checkout the latest code for ROS 2 Rolling, you can get the "
"relevant repository list by running:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:37
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:88
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:135
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:39
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:47
msgid ""
"$ cd ~/ros2_rolling\n"
"$ mv -i ros2.repos ros2.repos.old\n"
"$ wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/rolling/ros2.repos"
msgstr ""
"$ cd ~/ros2_rolling\n"
"$ mv -i ros2.repos ros2.repos.old\n"
"$ wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/rolling/ros2.repos"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:45
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:95
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:142
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:53
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:102
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:149
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:55
msgid "Use a Windows command line interface:"
msgstr "使用 Windows 命令行介面："

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:57
msgid ""
"$ cd \\dev\\ros2_rolling\n"
"$ curl -sk https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/rolling/ros2.repos -o "
"ros2.repos"
msgstr ""
"$ cd \\dev\\ros2_rolling\n"
"$ curl -sk https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/rolling/ros2.repos -o "
"ros2.repos"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:62
msgid "Or a powershell:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:64
msgid ""
"$ cd \\dev\\ros2_rolling\n"
"$ curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/rolling/ros2.repos -o "
"ros2.repos"
msgstr ""
"$ cd \\dev\\ros2_rolling\n"
"$ curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/rolling/ros2.repos -o "
"ros2.repos"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:71
msgid "Update your repositories"
msgstr "更新您的儲存庫"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:73
msgid ""
"You will notice that in the `ros2.repos <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/"
"ros2/ros2/rolling/ros2.repos>`__ file, each repository has a ``version`` "
"associated with it that points to a particular commit hash, tag, or branch "
"name. It is possible that these versions refer to new tags/branches that "
"your local copy of the repositories will not recognize as they are out-of-"
"date. Because of this, you should update the repositories that you have "
"already checked out with the following command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:77
msgid "$ vcs custom --args remote update"
msgstr "$ vcs custom --args remote update"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:82
msgid "Download the new source code"
msgstr "下載新的來源碼"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:84
msgid ""
"You should now be able to download the sources associated with the new "
"repository list with:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:90
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:97
msgid ""
"$ vcs import src < ros2.repos\n"
"$ vcs pull src"
msgstr ""
"$ vcs import src < ros2.repos\n"
"$ vcs pull src"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:104
msgid "In a Windows command line interface:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:106
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:113
msgid ""
"$ vcs import --input ros2.repos src\n"
"$ vcs pull src"
msgstr ""
"$ vcs import --input ros2.repos src\n"
"$ vcs pull src"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:111
msgid "Or in powershell:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:119
msgid "Rebuild your workspace"
msgstr "重新建置您的工作空間"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:121
msgid ""
"Now that the workspace is up to date with the latest sources, remove your "
"previous install and rebuild your workspace with, for example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:123
msgid "$ colcon build --symlink-install"
msgstr "$ colcon build --symlink-install"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:128
msgid "Inspect your source checkout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:130
msgid ""
"During your development you may have deviated from the original state of "
"your workspace from when you imported the repository list. If you wish to "
"know the versions of the set of repositories in your workspace, you can "
"export the information using the following command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:137
#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:144
msgid ""
"$ cd ~/ros2_rolling\n"
"$ vcs export src > my_ros2.repos"
msgstr ""
"$ cd ~/ros2_rolling\n"
"$ vcs export src > my_ros2.repos"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:151
msgid ""
"$ cd \\dev\\ros2_rolling\n"
"$ vcs export src > my_ros2.repos"
msgstr ""
"$ cd \\dev\\ros2_rolling\n"
"$ vcs export src > my_ros2.repos"

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Installation/Alternatives/Maintaining-a-Source-Checkout.rst:156
msgid ""
"This ``my_ros2.repos`` file can then be shared with others so that they can "
"reproduce the state of the repositories in your workspace."
msgstr ""
